# `{{dashCase name}}` Engineering Constitution (Spring Boot 4 / Java 21 Service)

## 1. Pure Functional Core (`ADR-007`)
- Keep domain logic in `src/main/java/com/cmp/service/domain/` 100% pure Java 21 (records, sealed interfaces, pure static functions) with zero `org.springframework.*` or `jakarta.servlet.*` imports.
- Enforced by `./gradlew codeQuality`.

## 2. Convention Plugin & Contract-First OpenAPI 3.1
- Applies `id("stefs.jvm-service")` from `../../build-logic` and shares `../../gradle/libs.versions.toml`.
- Exposes Actuator readiness/health (`/actuator/health`) and springdoc OpenAPI 3.1.0 specification (`/v3/api-docs`).

## 3. Verification Gate
Before any change is considered complete, all of the following must pass:
- `./gradlew codeQuality`
- `./gradlew assemble testClasses`
- `./gradlew test`
